---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import styles from '../styles/legal.module.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Us | WitrQuran"
  description="Contact Md Faruk Abdulla for questions, feedback, or reporting issues with WitrQuran."
>
  <div class={styles.pageContainer}>
    <nav class={styles.breadcrumb} aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Contact</span>
    </nav>

    <header class={styles.header}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>Contact Us</h1>
    </header>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <p>Have a question about WitrQuran</p>

      <p>Found something that is not working correctly</p>

      <p>Have feedback or a suggestion</p>

      <p>Want to report an issue with the Quran listening experience</p>

      <p>You can contact <strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong> directly</p>

      <h2>Contact Faruk</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is independently created and maintained by <strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong></p>

      <p>For the fastest response you can contact Faruk directly through Instagram or LinkedIn</p>

      <h3>Instagram</h3>

      <p>For the quickest response</p>

      <p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact Faruk on Instagram</a></p>

      <p>Instagram is the preferred channel for quick communication and you may receive a response much faster than email</p>

      <h3>LinkedIn</h3>

      <p>You can also contact Faruk directly on LinkedIn</p>

      <p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact Faruk on LinkedIn</a></p>

      <p>LinkedIn is also preferred for direct communication and quick responses</p>

      <h2>Email</h2>

      <p>For general questions feedback suggestions or other inquiries you can email</p>

      <p><strong><a href="mailto:witrfaruk@proton.me">witrfaruk@proton.me</a></strong></p>

      <p>Email is available for all types of inquiries but responses may take several hours or a few days depending on the request</p>

      <h2>GitHub</h2>

      <p>For technical issues contributions or questions related to the open source project you can visit the WitrQuran GitHub repository</p>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk/WitrQuran?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WitrQuran on GitHub</a></p>

      <p>You can also visit Faruk's GitHub profile</p>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Faruk on GitHub</a></p>

      <h2>Report an Error</h2>

      <p>Found an error or something that is not working as expected</p>

      <p>Please use our dedicated error reporting option so the issue can be reviewed and corrected</p>

      <p><a href="/report-error"><strong>Report an Error</strong></a></p>

      <p>When reporting an issue please provide enough information to help us understand what happened</p>

      <p>We may contact you if additional information is required</p>

      <p>Information submitted for an error report is used only for investigating and resolving the reported issue and is not intended to be permanently retained</p>

      <h2>Copyright Concerns</h2>

      <p>If you believe that any content available through WitrQuran infringes your copyright or other rights please contact us through the designated contact channel</p>

      <p>Please include the relevant details and explain the nature of your concern so it can be reviewed properly</p>

      <h2>Other Social Profiles</h2>

      <p>You can also find Faruk on the following platforms</p>

      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://x.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.threads.com/@witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Threads</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/witrfaruk/?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.pinterest.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pinterest</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://witrfaruk.vercel.app?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Faruk's Website</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Response Time</h2>

      <p>For the fastest communication please use Instagram or LinkedIn</p>

      <p>Email and other channels may take several hours or a few days to receive a response</p>

      <p>We appreciate your patience and every message that helps us improve WitrQuran</p>

      <h2>About WitrQuran</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is an open source Quran listening platform created to make listening to the Quran simple fast and free from unnecessary distractions</p>

      <p>The Quran is the Book of Almighty Allah SWT</p>

      <p>WitrQuran is simply a tool created to make listening easier for everyone by the will of Allah SWT</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
